						<v8:item>
							<v8:lang>en</v8:lang>
							<v8:content>It was decided to transfer the received goods to an isolated warehouse.
Select it for low-quality goods, decisions on which will be made later.
Create the "Goods transfer" document based on the certificate.
Restrictions on using goods are removed, separate warehousing of returned goods must be organized outside the system.</v8:content>
