							<v8:content>It was decided to write off the received goods in the warehouse.
You can select it for low-quality goods, as well as destroyed samples.
Next, create the "Inventory shortage write-off" document.
If you do not use warehouse management upon recording surpluses/shortages, specify the controlled lot in the document.</v8:content>
