						</v8:item>
						<v8:item>
							<v8:lang>en</v8:lang>
							<v8:content>The goods are not accepted into the warehouse and is immediately returned to the vendor.
Select it for low-quality goods or goods with quality variances, when the procedure of rejection during acceptance and return is agreed with the vendor.
Next, create a discrepancy report. If discrepancy reports are not used, correct the source documents of goods receipt.</v8:content>
